    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193149_678735_23669" xmi:uuid="2be8c03d-2113-4e19-9a06-dcc65e511cf6" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454506598108_211316_43383" xmi:uuid="ac64cbdb-6806-492b-91f2-a7f37b5199a9" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193149_678735_23669"/>
        <body>A ModifyElement is a type of DeltaChangeActivity that identifies one or several object that have been modified. &lt;example&gt;The geometric model of a part has been modified from version A to version B of a part. This change can be described by referencing with the attribute CurrentDesignObject of ModifyElement a GeometricModel representing the modified geometric model in version B. The ModifyElement object is referenced by a DeltaChange object via ChangeActivities. Finally, DeltaChange is referencing (via DescribedChange) a PartVersionRelationship where the related PartVersion represents version B of the part.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>ModifyElement</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193573_189636_26064" xmi:uuid="b8387c40-4791-4c63-b934-460bbefafe3c" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
