    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193014_190175_23383" xmi:uuid="64c42dcc-cd4d-40ed-a20f-a7a2144f0f20" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454502042822_248849_43354" xmi:uuid="6babd12f-ff5e-486d-aa1d-e1ab7d82078d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193014_190175_23383"/>
        <body>An AddElement is a type of DeltaChangeActivity that identifies one or several objects that have been added. &lt;example&gt;In version B of a part a new subcomponent C1 is added. This change can be described by referencing with the attribute CurrentDesignObject of AddElement an Occurrence representing the new subcomponent C1. The AddElement object is referenced by a DeltaChange object via ChangeActivities. Finally, DeltaChange is referencing (via DescribedChange) a PartVersionRelationship where the &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ProductDataManagement.htm#PartVersionRelationship.Related&lt;/path&gt; Related&lt;/a&gt; PartVersion represents version B of the part.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>AddElement</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193345_171771_24328" xmi:uuid="df5d63bc-32c6-44c0-ad0f-89d14586d326" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
