          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_b1702d9_1702999986298_867765_60061"/>
          <body>the text that specifies the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; 'decomposition': the Related DeltaChange is one of the components into which the Relating DeltaChange is broken down with no implication of 'sequence' or 'dependency'; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; 'dependency': The issuing of the Related DeltaChange is dependent on the issuing of the Relating DeltaChange; &lt;note&gt;The value 'dependency' does not imply the semantics of the values 'decomposition' or 'sequence'.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; 'precedence': The Related DeltaChange has higher priority than the Relating DeltaChange; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; 'sequence': The Relating DeltaChange shall be completed before the Related DeltaChange is given.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
