    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193065_368295_23508" xmi:uuid="f5dd80bf-5037-4051-a3e8-136961b44c80" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454506340158_624920_43370" xmi:uuid="a03babab-7b18-4dc8-b933-c918a346724a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193065_368295_23508"/>
        <body>A DeltaChange is a mechanism to describe changes in product data. It collects the change activities that describe the differences between the two objects referenced by the specified relationship object. &lt;example&gt;Consider two PartVersion objects A and B which are related by a PartVersionRelationship with &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ProductDataManagement.htm#PartVersionRelationship.RelationType&lt;/path&gt; RelationType&lt;/a&gt; 'sequence'. The attribute DescribedChange of DeltaChange references this PartVersionRelationship. The activities leading to the changes between version A and version B are collected by the attribute ChangeActivities. &lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>DeltaChange</name>
